[Nest] 27112  - 09/01/2026, 11:25:28 PM   ERROR [SchedulingIntegrityService] ⚠️ MISSING DOUBLE-BOOKING GUARD — the EXCLUSION constraint "appointments_no_overlap" is not installed on "appointments". Concurrent bookings for the same staff member and overlapping window can BOTH succeed. Most likely cause: this database was built with TYPEORM_SYNCHRONIZE=true, which skips the migration chain — and the constraint exists only in migration SQL (TypeORM cannot express EXCLUDE in entity metadata). Fix: run the migrations against this database (set TYPEORM_SYNCHRONIZE=false, or use test/setup-e2e-db.js for tests). If the ALTER fails, the table already contains overlapping rows — the diagnostic query is in the AppointmentNoOverlap migration.
